  "post_content": "<p>La asociaci&oacute;n &quot;Popar i criar&quot; de Onda ha finalizado hoy el curso en el Casal Jove, con una serie de actividades l&uacute;dicas, que han complementado las conferencias que han realizado en tres ciclos en el Local de Asociaciones, donde tiene la sede.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/poparicriarfinalactivitats/img_1185.jpg\" alt=\"img_1185\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/poparicriarfinalactivitats/img_1186.jpg\" alt=\"img_1186\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/poparicriarfinalactivitats/img_1187.jpg\" alt=\"img_1187\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/poparicriarfinalactivitats/img_1188.jpg\" alt=\"img_1188\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/poparicriarfinalactivitats/img_1189.jpg\" alt=\"img_1189\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/poparicriarfinalactivitats/img_1190.jpg\" alt=\"img_1190\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/poparicriarfinalactivitats/img_1191.jpg\" alt=\"img_1191\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/poparicriarfinalactivitats/img_1192.jpg\" alt=\"img_1192\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/poparicriarfinalactivitats/img_1193.jpg\" alt=\"img_1193\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/poparicriarfinalactivitats/img_1194.jpg\" alt=\"img_1194\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><im